// One labelled transition out of a composite and into a state inside another,
// `axis`'s `limit switch`. Neither composite holds both ends, so the label
// belongs to the root: on the leg between the two composites, clear of both
// borders, although two of the route's three pieces lie inside them.
chart crossing "a label between two composites" {
  state Left { state Busy, trans * -> Busy },
  state Right { state Idle, state Tripped, trans * -> Idle, trans Idle -> Tripped },

  trans * -> Left,
  trans Left -> Right/Tripped "limit switch",
}
